{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>聚餐後要拆分帳單與貼士，往往要按計算機按到手忙腳亂。Tipnook 讓用家輸入總額、調整貼士比例與人數，即時得出每人應付金額，並可把明細分享到聊天群組，適合經常與朋友、同事聚餐分帳的人。程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>貼士計算與精準分帳</h2>\n<p>Tipnook 把聚餐分帳化繁為簡。輸入帳單金額，轉動轉盤設定 0% 至 30% 貼士，或點選 15%、18%、20%、25%，再選 1 至 20 人分帳，即見每人應付金額。總額無法整除時，會列出兩個相差最小貨幣單位的金額，各人份額加起來剛好等於準確總數。明細可複製成文字或圖片貼到聊天群組，內建 15 種貨幣並支援離線使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-49-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-50-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-51-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-52-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-53-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Tipnook</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T06:13:53.546732+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":331,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}